oday again a backpack and a  notebook believed to be brian laundry's  found near these human remains again  they're not making an identification at  this point dana  uh laura katie padlets here wanted to  ask you about kind of this timeline and  the excruciating waiting that the family  and her friends in her hometown have  been going through uh gabby petitto was  reported missing by her family on  september 11th it's now october 20th so  can you talk about what you're seeing  and  what people are looking for in terms of  trying to at least get some closure here  yeah you know we were here just two  weeks ago interviewing the four parents  of gabby petito her mother nicole and  stepfather jim who live here in blue  point her father joe who lives in  florida along with his wife tara we  interviewed all four of them and the one  consistent thing they said was that they  were really hoping that brian laundry is  still hoping that brian laundry would be  found alive they have questions they  want to know what happened on that  cross-country road trip in wyoming they  want answers and not only that of course  if he is found to be responsible they  want justice for gabby  jesse i know you don't have a question  but you have a thought  my thought is the parents are guilty as  sin and they're involved in a conspiracy  to cover up their culpability in this  case  the guy comes home  without his fiancee  and the parents take him camping  and on the camping trip on the way back  they go by cell phones they all go by  cell phones now the cops looked at the  cell phones they didn't have any  evidence on them but did they also buy  burner phones did they buy a solar  charger because it appears like the  parents were in communication with this  guy brian possibly with the burner  phones through the attorney the  attorney's dirty attorney is crooked  obviously and if the brian guy calls the  attorney the attorney then tells the  parents what's going on with brian it's  privileged c