ll looking for people to come  forward you know we we've heard about  all these witnesses that saw the couple  fight brian and gabby along the way of  their summer trip they're still looking  for more information if anybody saw  anything to come forward and help them  kind of piece this all together but to  answer your question no no other persons  of interest have been identified  thanks laura great job

